      "stop_reason": "CANDIDATES_EXHAUSTED_FIT_SKIP",
      "text": "Summit County, Ohio\n\nSummit County is an urban county in the U.S. state of Ohio.\n\n Its county seat is Akron.\n\n It was named \"Summit County\" because the highest elevation on the Ohio and Erie Canal is located in the county.\n\nHelena\u2013West Helena, Arkansas\n\nHelena\u2013West Helena is the county seat of and the largest city within Phillips County, Arkansas, United States.\n\n Helena is sited on lowlands between the Mississippi River and the eastern side of Crowley's Ridge.\n\n West Helena is located on the western side of Crowley's Ridge, a geographic anomaly in the typically flat Arkansas Delta.\n\nScapegoat Mountain is a summit in the Scapegoat Wilderness of Lewis and Clark County, Montana, in the United States.\n\nMcRae\u2013Helena, Georgia\n\n McRae\u2013Helena is the county seat of Telfair County.\n\nHelena, Arkansas\n\nHelena is the eastern portion of Helena-West Helena, Arkansas, a city in Phillips County, Arkansas.\n\n Helena was the county seat of Phillips County until January 1, 2006, when it merged its government and city limits with neighboring West Helena.\n\nLewis and Clark County, Montana\n\n Its county seat is Helena, the state capital.",
